cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software (below) and the paper in preferred-citation."
type: software
title: "Lignin_Forward_Gen: a forward kinetic Monte Carlo generator for linkage-resolved lignin structure"
abstract: >-
  A minimal, transparent forward kinetic Monte Carlo generator that predicts the
  native lignin inter-unit linkage inventory (beta-O-4, beta-5, beta-beta, beta-1,
  5-5, 4-O-5) from monomer composition (S/G ratio) alone. The linkage distribution
  emerges from radical-coupling propensities rather than being imposed as a target.
